# Copy to .env and adjust. Every value below has a working default.

# FHIR server. The public HAPI sandbox is used for the demo because Docker is not
# available locally; see README for the local JPA-starter path in production.
FHIR_BASE_URL=https://hapi.fhir.org/baseR4
FHIR_TIMEOUT_S=30

# Where the pipeline reads and writes: 'sandbox' (the above URL) or 'dry-run'.
#
# 'dry-run' serves the seeded dataset from memory and keeps writes for the life of the
# process, so the pipeline — correlation, validation, dispense, audit chain, the scrubbed
# alert — runs end to end without touching, or writing to, the shared sandbox. It is what
# `make run-offline` and the offline test suite use.
#
# It is *not* fully offline. The RxNorm lookup below is a separate service and still goes
# out, because the brief asks for a real code lookup and replaying recordings in the demo
# would hide the one integration most worth showing. `make test` replays recorded RxNav
# payloads and needs no network at all. If NLM is unreachable the run ends as a clean
# 'error' (503) rather than a crash — the check did not run, so nothing is dispensed.
FHIR_MODE=sandbox

# RxNav / RxNorm REST. No API key, no registration.
RXNAV_BASE_URL=https://rxnav.nlm.nih.gov/REST
RXNAV_TIMEOUT_S=20
RXNAV_CACHE_TTL_S=3600

# Every client-assigned FHIR id is prefixed with this namespace, so a run can never
# collide with, or overwrite, another candidate's records on the shared public sandbox.
#
# The default is the namespace the demo dataset is already published under, so a fresh
# clone can run `make verify` and `make run` immediately, and `make seed` is a no-op.
#
# CHANGE THIS only if you want your own copy — and if you do, HAPI enforces uniqueness on
# Patient.identifier *globally*, so MRN12345 can have only one owner. A new namespace is
# not enough on its own: you must also change MRN, PLACER_ORDER_NUMBER and
# FILLER_ORDER_NUMBER in app/demo.py, and update the HL7 fixtures' PID-3 and ORC-2/ORC-3
# to match. `make seed` prints exactly these instructions if it hits the conflict.
DEMO_NAMESPACE=sajib-cc-58f1
